.build/
# Shared native modules staged from the fork tree by build.sh (canonical:
# firmware/lilygo_t_deck_plus_micropython/native/).
native/.staged/
# modules/ mixes board-authored files (tracked, whitelisted below) with copies
# staged at build time from runtime/ and from the fork build's modules/ tree --
# the canonical sources live there and board.toml declares which of them cross.
#
# The whitelist is ALSO what the stager's prune reads: it asks `git ls-files`
# inside modules/, treats a tracked file as board-authored and never deletes it,
# and deletes any untracked .py that board.toml no longer stages. So a new
# board-authored module has to be listed here, or the next build removes it.
modules/*
!modules/boot.py
!modules/main.py
!modules/moybyte_shell.py
!modules/tdeck_panel.py
!modules/tdeck_smoke.py
!modules/moy_runtime.py
